WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.039 --> 00:00:03.127
Roxy ran outside.

2
00:00:03.128 --> 00:00:05.317
She shot into the air.

3
00:00:05.318 --> 00:00:09.288
"I wish I could eat my ice cream sandwich," Roxy thought.

4
00:00:09.289 --> 00:00:11.756
"But I have more important things to do now.

5
00:00:11.757 --> 00:00:17.072
I have to find out who stole the delivery truck."

6
00:00:17.073 --> 00:00:19.316
Roxy flew over Route 80.

7
00:00:19.317 --> 00:00:21.925
She saw a big crack in the road.

8
00:00:21.926 --> 00:00:26.526
"Whoa!" Roxy said. "Was there an earthquake?"

9
00:00:26.527 --> 00:00:31.721
She saw Detective Smith talking to a truck driver. She flew down.

10
00:00:31.722 --> 00:00:34.265
"Hey, Detective," Roxy said.

11
00:00:34.266 --> 00:00:37.251
"I know you're angry that a truck was stolen.

12
00:00:37.252 --> 00:00:39.750
But you shouldn't smash the road."

13
00:00:39.751 --> 00:00:44.763
Detective Smith rolled his eyes. "Very funny, Rocket Girl.

14
00:00:44.764 --> 00:00:47.652
I didn't smash the road."

15
00:00:47.653 --> 00:00:50.946
"Quake Man did that!" the truck driver said.

16
00:00:50.947 --> 00:00:53.986
"Who's Quake Man?" Roxy asked.

17
00:00:53.987 --> 00:00:57.588
"He's the guy who stole my truck," the driver said.

18
00:00:57.589 --> 00:01:01.654
Just then his belly growled. He shook his head.

19
00:01:01.655 --> 00:01:05.504
"Sorry about that. I still haven't had lunch today."

20
00:01:05.505 --> 00:01:07.705
Detective Smith took out his notepad.

21
00:01:07.706 --> 00:01:09.977
"Tell us everything that happened."

22
00:01:09.978 --> 00:01:14.204
The driver nodded. "Okay. I was driving.

23
00:01:14.205 --> 00:01:16.692
Suddenly the road shook.

24
00:01:16.693 --> 00:01:19.307
Big cracks formed all over it.

25
00:01:19.308 --> 00:01:22.603
I slammed on my brakes."

26
00:01:22.604 --> 00:01:25.766
"What happened after that?" Roxy asked.

27
00:01:25.767 --> 00:01:28.893
"A guy opened the door," the driver said.

28
00:01:28.894 --> 00:01:31.394
"He called himself Quake Man.

29
00:01:31.395 --> 00:01:33.929
He told me to get out of the truck.

30
00:01:33.930 --> 00:01:37.281
Then he got in and drove away!"

31
00:01:37.282 --> 00:01:40.748
"I don't understand," Detective Smith said.

32
00:01:40.749 --> 00:01:44.082
"How did Quake Man break the road?"

33
00:01:44.083 --> 00:01:47.354
"He had a huge arm," the driver said.

34
00:01:47.355 --> 00:01:50.955
"It looked like a machine—or a jackhammer.

35
00:01:50.956 --> 00:01:54.816
He used it to break the road!"

36
00:01:54.817 --> 00:01:57.296
"Oh boy," Roxy said.

37
00:01:57.297 --> 00:02:01.627
"Quake Man sounds dangerous. I have to stop him!"

38
00:02:01.628 --> 00:02:04.914
"I forgot to ask," Detective Smith said.

39
00:02:04.915 --> 00:02:08.494
"What was in the truck? It must be something valuable.

40
00:02:08.495 --> 00:02:12.087
Maybe jewelry or money or artwork?"

41
00:02:12.088 --> 00:02:17.128
"Nope," the driver said. "The truck's filled with mattresses."

42
00:02:17.129 --> 00:02:21.165
Roxy raised an eyebrow. "Mattresses?"

43
00:02:21.166 --> 00:02:23.324
"Yep," the driver said.

44
00:02:23.325 --> 00:02:25.515
Detective Smith tapped his chin.

45
00:02:25.516 --> 00:02:30.211
"They must be expensive mattresses. Right?"

46
00:02:30.212 --> 00:02:31.808
The driver shook his head.

47
00:02:31.809 --> 00:02:33.790
"They're cheap mattresses.

48
00:02:33.791 --> 00:02:36.691
I was going to deliver them to Mattress Mart.

49
00:02:36.692 --> 00:02:39.383
There's a big sale this weekend."

50
00:02:39.384 --> 00:02:41.948
"That's odd," Roxy said.

51
00:02:41.949 --> 00:02:46.390
"Why would a thief steal a truck filled with cheap mattresses?"

52
00:02:46.391 --> 00:02:49.530
Detective Smith's phone rang.

53
00:02:49.531 --> 00:02:54.230
"Hello? Really? That's strange.

54
00:02:54.231 --> 00:02:59.033
We'll be there right away!" He put his phone away.

55
00:02:59.034 --> 00:03:02.270
"Quake Man stole another truck," he said.

56
00:03:02.271 --> 00:03:05.154
"You'll never believe what was in it."

57
00:03:05.155 --> 00:03:08.092
"What was in it?" Roxy asked.

58
00:03:08.093 --> 00:03:12.492
Detective Smith snorted. "Bananas!"

59
00:03:12.493 --> 00:03:16.890
The driver's belly growled again.

